A||||1||87FieroGT||Cruise control doesn't work.
Z||000000||87FieroGT||08-31-99||10:38 PM||||   My cruise control has never worked since I bought the car. What are the first things that I should check to get it fixed. The auto manuals don't help much.
Z||000001||WisconsinGT||09-01-99||12:03 AM||||The vacuum canister between the engine and the storage compartment, on the drivers side  would be my first choice. If it has any holes in it (from rust), then you need a new one.
